{"tool_name":"yrgate","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"yrgate","home":"http://www.plantgdb.org/prj/yrGATE/","license":"Not licensed","summary":"Web-based gene-structure annotation tool for the identification and dissemination of eukaryotic genes.","addition_date":"2017-08-20T17:40:59Z","last_update_date":"2020-01-19T17:47:47Z","tool_type":["Web application"],"collections":["Animal and Crop Genomics"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:yrgate","credit":[{"email":"vbrendel@iastate.edu","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["General"],"url":"http://www.plantgdb.org/help/"}],"edit_permission":{"authors":["animalandcropgenomics"],"type":"group"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Query and retrieval","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0224"}]}],"name":"yrGATE","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"admin","publication":[{"doi":"10.1186/gb-2006-7-7-r58","metadata":{"abstract":"Your Gene structure Annotation Tool for Eukaryotes (yrGATE) provides an Annotation Tool and Community Utilities for worldwide web-based community genome and gene annotation. Annotators can evaluate gene structure evidence derived from multiple sources to create gene structure annotations. Administrators regulate the acceptance of annotations into published gene sets. yrGATE is designed to facilitate rapid and accurate annotation of emerging genomes as well as to confirm, refine, or correct currently published annotations. yrGATE is highly portable and supports different standard input and output formats. The yrGATE software and usage cases are available at http://www.plantgdb.org/ prj/yrGATE. \u00a9 2006 Wilkerson et al.; licensee BioMed Central Ltd.","authors":[{"name":"Brendel V."},{"name":"Schlueter S.D."},{"name":"Wilkerson M.D."}],"citationCount":17,"date":"2006-07-19T00:00:00Z","journal":"Genome Biology","title":"yrGATE: A web-based gene-structure annotation tool for the identification and d